<td>
<h5 style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><strong>A Degree With a Guarantee</strong><br /></span></h5>
<p><span style="background-color: #ccffff;"><span style="color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;">The Associate in Arts (AA-T) and Associate in Science (AS-T) Degrees for Transfer at Lake Tahoe Community College can save you time and money, and guarantees you a seat at a California State University school in your chosen major. Complete 90 quarter units at LTCC, get your Associate Degree for Transfer, and you're guaranteed a spot at a CSU to finish the other 60 semester units for your bachelor's degree. Tuition for two years at LTCC (3 quarters/year, 12 units/quarter) costs approximately $2,232 for California residents and Dreamers - unless you're a first-time, full-time Promise student (<a href="https://www.ltcc.edu/admissions/financial-aid/laketahoe_collegepromise/index.php" target="_blank" rel="noopener">check to see if you qualify</a>! NV residents &amp; Dreamers within the Tahoe Basin too!). Tuition for two years at a CSU costs approximately $11,484. By completing your first two years at LTCC, you save about $9,252 in earning your CSU four-year degree!</span><br /></span></p>
<h5>&nbsp;</h5>
<h5>Associate in Arts for Transfer (AA-T)</h5>
<ul>
<li>
<div><a title="Anthropology" href="https://www.ltcc.edu/academics/academic_programs/anthropology.php" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Anthropology</a></div>
</li>
<li>
<div><a title="Elementary Teacher Education" href="https://www.ltcc.edu/academics/academic_programs/elementaryteachereducation.php" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Elementary Teacher Education</a></div>
</li>
<li>
<div><a title="English" href="https://www.ltcc.edu/academics/academic_programs/english.php" target="_blank" rel="noopener">English</a></div>
</li>
<li>
<div><a title="Geography" href="https://www.ltcc.edu/academics/academic_programs/science/geology.php" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Geography</a></div>
</li>
<li>
<div><a title="Kinesiology" href="https://www.ltcc.edu/academics/academic_programs/kinesiology.php" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kinesiology</a></div>
</li>
<li><a href="https://www.ltcc.edu/academics/academic_programs/socialscience/politicalsci.php">Political Science</a></li>
<li>
<div><a title="Psychology" href="https://www.ltcc.edu/academics/academic_programs/psychology.php" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Psychology</a></div>
</li>
<li>
<div><a title="Sociology" href="https://www.ltcc.edu/academics/academic_programs/sociology.php" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Sociology</a></div>
</li>
<li>
<div><a title="Spanish" href="https://www.ltcc.edu/academics/academic_programs/world_languages.php" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Spanish</a></div>
</li>
<li>
<div><a title="Studio Arts" href="https://www.ltcc.edu/academics/academic_programs/art.php" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Studio Arts</a></div>
</li>
</ul>
